//   - G_SUBCLASS_SIZES_SPEC15: [(u32, u32); 6]   (sub_A, sub_B) per G
//
// FROM: `docs/video/msmpeg4/spec/15-count-ab-per-g-family.md` §3 (binary)
// FROM: constructor disassembly `mb_mv_struct_init` at VMA `0x1c210643`
//       in mpg4c32.dll (SHA-256 aedb4cf3...b3c099).
include!(concat!(env!("OUT_DIR"), "/g_counts.rs"));

// Generated by build.rs from `tables/region_05f0d8.hex` /
// `region_05f4a0.hex` / `region_05f868.hex` / `region_05fc30.hex` —
// MS-MPEG4 v3 intra-DC custom direct-value VLCs, per
